{#
Response to creating, editing, removing or suspending a user: refresh the list
and close.

The whole frame is replaced rather than one row, for the same reason the
integrations list is: adding or removing an administrator changes what the
*other* rows may do — the delete button disappears from the last admin — and
the list is small enough that redrawing it costs nothing.

Accepts:
    toastMessage  optional message key; a refusal to report, or a suspension
                  to confirm. Null on the ordinary save, which needs no toast:
                  the row redrawing with the new name IS the confirmation.
    toastType     'error' | 'success' | 'info', see _partials/_toast.html.twig
#}
{% if toastMessage is defined and toastMessage is not null %}
    {# Before the list, so the toast is appended even if rendering the frame
       below fails on something — a refusal that is swallowed by a template
       error is the exact failure this variable exists to end. #}
    <turbo-stream action="append" target="toast-region">
        <template>
            {% include '_partials/_toast.html.twig' with {
                message: toastMessage|trans,
                type:    toastType|default('error'),
            } only %}
        </template>
    </turbo-stream>
{% endif %}

<turbo-stream action="replace" target="admin-users">
    <template>
        {% include 'admin/user/_users_frame.html.twig' %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
